  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186115299,
      "id": "f9469d5c-e097-590c-8ddb-2c7fda353fac",
      "title": "Classifying a System as Consistent Dependent, Consistent Independent, or Inconsistent"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "f1722f8c-db3e-562c-80ac-1606557dd132",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x+y+3z &=1 \\\\ 2x+3y+9z &=1 \\\\ -x+y+3z &=-3\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The system is consistent independent\n- **II.** The system is consistent dependent\n- **III.** The system is inconsistent",
      ":question/worked-solution": "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 9 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 3 & -3\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 3 & 9 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 3 & -3\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(-2){R}_{1} \\\\ & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 3 & -3\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(1){R}_{1} \\\\ & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 6 & -2\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-2){R}_{2} \\\\ & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & 1 & 3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe basic variables are the variables whose coefficients are pivots. Here there is one free variable, $z$. Therefore, since there are infinitely many solutions, we conclude that the system is *consistent dependent*.\n\nAs a result, only statement II is true.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "416727cc-1c0b-5a7b-bd4c-dd80ee682af0",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/checkbox",
