  {
    "knowledge_point": {
      "db_id": 17592186115299,
      "id": "f9469d5c-e097-590c-8ddb-2c7fda353fac",
      "title": "Classifying a System as Consistent Dependent, Consistent Independent, or Inconsistent"
    },
    "question": {
      ":question/id": "81caf5b4-044f-5b41-8287-568e96894a06",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the following system of equations.\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}x-2y-3z &=4 \\\\ -2x+5y+7z &=-11 \\\\ x-4y-5z &=10\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The system is inconsistent\n- **II.** The system is consistent independent\n- **III.** The system is consistent dependent",
      ":question/worked-solution": "To classify the system, we first need to find its solution. The augmented matrix for this system is\n\n$$\nM=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & -3 & 4 \\\\ -2 & 5 & 7 & -11 \\\\ 1 & -4 & -5 & 10\\end{array}\\right].\n$$\n\nUsing the method of Gaussian elimination, we can reduce this matrix to row echelon form as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}M & =\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & -3 & 4 \\\\ -2 & 5 & 7 & -11 \\\\ 1 & -4 & -5 & 10\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(2){R}_{1} \\\\ & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & -3 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 1 & -4 & -5 & 10\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(-1){R}_{1} \\\\ & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & -3 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & -2 & -2 & 6\\end{array}\\right] & {R}_{3}:={R}_{3}+(2){R}_{2} \\\\ & \u223c\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}1 & -2 & -3 & 4 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{array}\\right]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe basic variables are the variables whose coefficients are pivots. Here there is one free variable, $z$. Therefore, since there are infinitely many solutions, we conclude that the system is *consistent dependent*.\n\nAs a result, only statement III is true.",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "e3ab0cc8-080b-52da-9524-811f24e13cf0",
          ":answer-field/key": "I",
